OL,3,GNEWSADry weather reveals medieval
OL,4,Ahunting lodge remains
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe foundations of a 15th Century
OL,7,Fhunting lodge in Sheffield have been
OL,8,Frevealed thanks to the recent months of
OL,9,Fhot, dry weather.
OL,11,FThe first record of the lodge on the
OL,12,Fsite of Manor Park, a medieval
OL,13,Fdeerb@/park, dates back to 1479 when
OL,14,FGeorge Talbot, the 4thb@/Earl of
OL,15,FShrewsbury paid for repairs to be
OL,16,Fcarried out there.
OL,18,FThe building was dismantled over 300
OL,19,Fyears ago, but following prolonged dry
OL,20,Fconditions over the summer, its traces
OL,21,Fcan once again be seen.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
